OWNER:
- Can add members to project
- Can remove members from project
- Can promote MEMBER → ADMIN
- Can demote ADMIN → MEMBER
- Can transfer ownership
- Can only be 1 per project
- Can assign tasks to any project member
- Can modify tasks
- Can delete tasks
- Can modify project attributes (name, description, deadline, etc.)
- Can delete project


ADMIN:
- Can add members to project
- Can remove MEMBERs from project
- Can promote MEMBER → ADMIN
- Cannot demote ADMINs or OWNER
- Cannot remove ADMINs or OWNER
- Can assign tasks to any project member
- Can modify tasks
- Can delete tasks
- Can modify project attributes (name, description, deadline, etc.)
- Cannot delete project


MEMBER:
- Cannot add/remove members
- Cannot promote/demote members
- Cannot modify project
- Cannot delete project
- Cannot modify/delete tasks
- Can be assigned tasks
- Can view project and its tasks



Rules
PROJECT:
- Exactly 1 OWNER
- A user can have at most 1 membership per project
- New members always join as MEMBER
- A task can only be assigned to a member of its project
- Removing a member unassigns their tasks


OWNERSHIP:
- Only OWNER can transfer ownership
- Ownership transfer swaps roles:
    OWNER → target's previous role
    target → OWNER
- OWNER cannot simply demote themselves
- There can only ever be 1 OWNER
